---
import { MILESTONES } from '../../data/milestones';
import SceneVideo from '../SceneVideo.astro';
import { type Locale } from '../../i18n';

interface Props {
  locale?: Locale;
}

const { locale = 'es' } = Astro.props;
const milestone = MILESTONES[5];
---

<section 
  id="scene-6" 
  class="scene" 
  data-scene="paris" 
  data-year={milestone.year}
  data-pi-value={milestone.precisionValue}
  data-theme={milestone.theme}
  data-scene-title={milestone.title[locale]}
>
  <div class="stage">
    <!-- Cinematic Atmospheric Video Background (Versailles French Oak Parquet & Sunlight) -->
    <SceneVideo 
      src="/videos/06-buffon.mp4" 
      poster="/images/06-buffon.jpg" 
      blend="normal" 
      opacity={0.38} 
    />

    <!-- Narrative Header (Uncollapsible, balanced typography positioned cleanly above rig) -->
    <div class="narrative">
      <div class="beat" data-beat="0.05-0.38">
        <span class="scene-kicker">06 // PARÍS, 1777 d.C. · CONDE DE BUFFON</span>
        <h2 class="scene-title">{milestone.title[locale]}</h2>
        <p class="beat-text">
          {locale === 'es'
            ? 'En su salón parisino, Georges-Louis Leclerc, Conde de Buffon, descubrió algo casi sobrenatural: si arrojas agujas de coser al azar sobre un suelo de tablones de madera y cuentas cuántas cruzan las juntas entre tablas, π emerge de la nada sin un solo círculo a la vista.'
            : 'In his Parisian salon, Georges-Louis Leclerc, Count of Buffon, discovered something almost supernatural: toss sewing needles at random upon a floor of wooden parquet and count how many cross the seams between boards, and π emerges out of nowhere with not a single circle in sight.'}
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="beat" data-beat="0.42-0.80">
        <span class="scene-kicker">06 // LA PROBABILIDAD GEOMÉTRICA</span>
        <h2 class="scene-title">El Teorema del Suelo de Parquet</h2>
        <p class="beat-text">
          {locale === 'es'
            ? 'La probabilidad exacta de cruce es 2L / (π · D). Con agujas de longitud L = D/2, basta dividir el total de agujas entre las que cruzan la junta para ver a π converger en vivo delante de tus ojos.'
            : 'The exact probability of crossing is 2L / (π · D). With needles of length L = D/2, simply dividing total needles by crossings reveals π converging live before your eyes.'}
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="beat beat-climax" data-beat="0.84-0.98">
        <blockquote class="buffon-quote">
          <p>«π ya no pertenecía solo a los círculos. Estaba escondido en el tejido mismo del azar.»</p>
          <cite>— Essai d’arithmétique morale (1777)</cite>
        </blockquote>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Buffon Interactive Laboratory Rig Architecture -->
    <div class="buffon-rig">
      <!-- Museum Catalog Technical Plate (In-Flow, Zero HUD Overlap) -->
      <div class="museum-plate">
        [ FIG. 06 // PARÍS, 1777 — PARQUET DEL CONDE DE BUFFON — LABORATORIO MONTE CARLO ]
      </div>

      <!-- French Oak Parquet Board Canvas -->
      <div class="canvas-container blueprint-panel">
        <canvas id="buffon-canvas" class="buffon-canvas"></canvas>
      </div>

      <!-- Interactive Monte Carlo Laboratory Toolbar -->
      <div class="buffon-toolbar">
        <button type="button" id="buffon-toss-50" class="lab-btn" title="Arrojar 50 agujas de latón al parquet">
          <span>🎯 ARROJAR 50 AGUJAS</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" id="buffon-toss-200" class="lab-btn lab-btn-accent" title="Arrojar 200 agujas para acelerar la convergencia">
          <span>⚡ MUESTREO RÁPIDO (200)</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" id="buffon-clear" class="lab-btn lab-btn-dim" title="Limpiar agujas del tablero">
          <span>🧹 LIMPIAR TABLERO</span>
        </button>
      </div>

      <!-- Archimedes Gold Standard Technical Math Table (Zero SaaS border-radius) -->
      <div class="math-panel blueprint-panel">
        <div class="math-col">
          <span class="col-title">AGUJAS EN EL SUELO (N)</span>
          <span class="col-formula tabular">Muestreo estocástico</span>
          <strong id="buffon-total" class="col-val tabular">0</strong>
        </div>

        <div class="math-divider"></div>

        <div class="math-col">
          <span class="col-title">CRUCES DE JUNTA (C)</span>
          <span class="col-formula tabular">Agujas verdes que tocan corte</span>
          <strong id="buffon-cross" class="col-val col-accent tabular">0</strong>
        </div>

        <div class="math-divider"></div>

        <div class="math-col">
          <span class="col-title">ESTIMACIÓN DE π</span>
          <span id="buffon-error-rate" class="col-formula tabular">π ≈ N / C (con L = D/2)</span>
          <strong id="buffon-pi-val" class="col-val col-gold tabular">---</strong>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  import { BuffonSimulation } from '../../scripts/buffon';

  const canvas = document.getElementById('buffon-canvas') as HTMLCanvasElement | null;
  if (canvas) {
    new BuffonSimulation(canvas);
  }
</script>

<style>
  .scene {
    height: 380vh;
    position: relative;
    --p: 0;
  }

  .stage {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    height: 100vh;
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: flex-start;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, #1b1713 0%, #090706 100%);
    padding: calc(var(--hud-height, 68px) + 12px) 20px 16px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  /* Uncollapsible Narrative Box Positioned Above Rig */
  .narrative {
    position: relative;
    width: 100% !important;
    max-width: min(90vw, 740px) !important;
    min-height: 115px;
    margin: 0 auto !important;
    text-align: center !important;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 5;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .scene-kicker {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    color: #c59b27;
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .scene-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3.4vw, 2.4rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-style: italic;
    color: #fff;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    filter: url(#ink-displacement);
  }

  .beat-text {
    font-family: var(--font-editorial);
    font-size: clamp(0.92rem, 1.7vw, 1.05rem);
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .buffon-quote {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 2.5vw, 1.7rem);
    font-style: italic;
    color: #c59b27;
    line-height: 1.45;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .buffon-quote cite {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    font-style: normal;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
    margin-top: 8px;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  /* Buffon Laboratory Rig Architecture */
  .buffon-rig {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 760px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    z-index: 2;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  /* French Oak Parquet Board Canvas Container */
  .canvas-container {
    width: 100%;
    height: 200px;
    background: rgba(16, 12, 8, 0.55);
    backdrop-filter: blur(3px);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .buffon-canvas {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: block;
  }

  /* Interactive Laboratory Toolbar */
  .buffon-toolbar {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 8px;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .lab-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--bg-surface) 90%, transparent);
    border: 1px solid var(--grid-line);
    color: var(--fg-ink);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    padding: 6px 14px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .lab-btn:hover {
    border-color: #c59b27;
    color: #c59b27;
    background: rgba(197, 155, 39, 0.12);
  }

  .lab-btn-accent {
    border-color: rgba(57, 255, 136, 0.4);
    color: #39ff88;
  }

  .lab-btn-accent:hover {
    border-color: #39ff88;
    color: #39ff88;
    background: rgba(57, 255, 136, 0.15);
  }

  .lab-btn-dim {
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .lab-btn-dim:hover {
    border-color: var(--muted);
    color: var(--fg-ink);
  }

  /* Technical Math Panel */
  .math-panel {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-around;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 10px 16px;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .math-col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    gap: 2px;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .col-title {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.62rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .col-formula {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
  }

  .col-val {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--fg-ink);
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .col-accent {
    color: #39ff88;
  }

  .col-gold {
    color: #ffd700;
  }

  .math-divider {
    width: 1px;
    height: 38px;
    background: var(--grid-line);
  }

  @media (max-height: 750px) {
    .canvas-container {
      height: 160px;
    }
    .narrative {
      min-height: 95px;
    }
  }
</style>
